.fam
.fi
.if n .RE
.sp
\~
.br
The entries are treated as key\-value pairs. The equal operator (=) is mandatory, but can be used with spaces around. The entries can be placed in any order inside the version section.
.sp
.RS 4
.ie n \{\
\h'-04'\(bu\h'+03'\c
.\}
