\fBREFERENCES\fP is a list of URLs separated by blank, which contain additional information about the Note definition and the content. If you need to use a \*(Aqblank\*(Aq inside the URL definition please mask it as \*(Aq%20\*(Aq.
.RE
.sp
Example:
